WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.423 --> 00:00:05.804
- [Voiceover] Dear past me,

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:07.064
I know it's been awhile but it's

00:00:07.064 --> 00:00:10.335
because I've been trying
to grow and get better.

00:00:10.335 --> 00:00:12.326
And I know things are
hard for you right now,

00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:13.972
no matter how hard to try,

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.755
you just can't seem to make Mom happy.

00:00:16.755 --> 00:00:18.909
And I know Mom says some really

00:00:18.909 --> 00:00:21.062
hurtful things to you sometimes

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:23.155
and you feel like you deserve it

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:26.284
and I know you get angry at yourself a lot

00:00:26.284 --> 00:00:27.686
and you're frustrated

00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:29.311
and you feel like you're worthless

00:00:29.311 --> 00:00:31.323
so you tell yourself that all the time

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:34.310
but I promise you you're not worthless.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:37.052
Don't forget that you
can always ask for help.

00:00:37.052 --> 00:00:39.713
Even if it's just somebody to talk to.

00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:40.790
You've been told that you should believe

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.822
and listen to everything your parents say

00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:45.321
but nobody is perfect.

00:00:45.321 --> 00:00:47.150
So sometimes they make mistakes

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.283
and sometimes they hurt themselves

00:00:49.283 --> 00:00:50.624
and hurt you.

00:00:50.624 --> 00:00:52.026
And all because they're trying to love you

00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:53.610
but don't know how.

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.638
And I want you to know
that I still love Mom.

00:00:56.638 --> 00:00:58.872
And I've come to terms
with the fact that she may

00:00:58.872 --> 00:01:03.450
never understand the kind
of pain she's made me feel.

00:01:03.484 --> 00:01:04.927
And I wish Mom would realize

00:01:04.927 --> 00:01:08.753
that she deserves to love herself too.

00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:11.306
But there's little I can do.

00:01:11.306 --> 00:01:12.668
I'm not as close with her anymore

00:01:12.668 --> 00:01:15.878
but that's okay 'cause some relationships

00:01:15.878 --> 00:01:17.727
work better at a distance.

00:01:17.727 --> 00:01:19.677
Even if you're born into it.

00:01:19.677 --> 00:01:23.476
And it's gonna be hard but
it'll get better I promise

00:01:23.476 --> 00:01:25.418
because in the end,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.060
all you need to do is love yourself

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.721
and be kind to yourself.

00:01:30.721 --> 00:01:32.753
Allow yourself to grow.

00:01:32.753 --> 00:01:35.211
I want you to know that I love you

00:01:35.211 --> 00:01:37.466
and you should love you too.

00:01:37.466 --> 00:01:39.396
I know you're gonna do great.

00:01:39.396 --> 00:01:43.730
(instrumental piano music)

